 "remarks": "Luxury Estate Rental in the Heart of South Wilton  Experience exceptional country living in this stunning private estate, set on beautifully landscaped grounds in one of South Wilton's most desirable locations. Surrounded by expansive level lawns, this impressive residence offers the perfect blend of elegance, comfort, and modern efficiency. Designed for both everyday living and effortless entertaining, the home features gracious living spaces, soaring ceilings, abundant natural light, and seamless access to spectacular outdoor amenities. Spend your summers enjoying the heated gunite pool w/ automatic cover, relax in the open cabana, or entertain guests on the expansive terraces overlooking the picturesque grounds. Adding to the home's appeal are newly installed solar panels, providing exceptional energy efficiency and lower utility costs. The expansive grounds offer endless space for recreation, outdoor gatherings, and peaceful enjoyment in a private setting. Conveniently located just minutes from town, award winning schools, shopping, dining, and commuting routes, this exceptional rental offers a rare opportunity to enjoy resort style living in one of Wilton's premier neighborhoods.",
